# Refine Rule on Violation

Whenever the user asks the AI to explain why the agent did not follow a rule:
1. The agent must examine the relevant rule.
2. The agent must refine or clarify the rule as needed to ensure it will be followed in the future.
3. The agent should document the refinement in an action report for traceability.
